          "start_ms": null,
          "status": "machine-unreviewed",
          "text": "Summary: Observation of the presence and then the movement of a dark, pebble-shaped phenomenon with two red lights in front and behind, and the presence of a high-pitched humming: unexplained, somewhat strange, observation of good consistency.",
          "translation_text_sha256": "53cd87665978b199f95c8b84c77b87cd929441132561c2ba6368338a90f2756f"
        },
